  "narrative": {
    "intro": "The Top small-business government contractors ranking for FY2027 to date shows $931M in contract obligations across the listed small firms. THUNDERCAT TECHNOLOGY, LLC leads the ranking with $154M in obligations. PEACHTREE LUMBER COMPANY, INC follows with $99.6M. VETERANS DEVELOPMENT CORPORATION, INC. obligated $63.1M, and IMPULSE SPACE, INC. obligated $37.1M. The remaining firms on the list include BLUESTAQ LLC at $24.3M, METROIBR JV LLC at $22.7M, PRIMARY CARE SOLUTIONS INC at $22.4M, VALIANT CONSTRUCTION LLC at $22.3M, PINTER MEMORIALS INC at $22M, and MATOS-GRUNLEY JOINT VENTURE at $21.4M. All figures are contract obligations and current-year totals are partial, fiscal year to date. Use the listed obligations to identify top small-business partners and to prioritize outreach or compliance checks based on observed award sizes.",
